      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So I use @{5e44a1bd0c91c2477a8b8acb|full_name}'s custom locomotion controllers for my avatars and I notice this happens to me when I'm prone and open any main menu. What I notice is my custom prone gets overridden whenever I open a main menu and it causes my position to be adjusted at the same time causing my view to be further away from the main menu.\nVideo: https://files.catbox.moe/z2znjd.mp4",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
